#. 【立会人】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[witness]"
msgstr ""

#. え？　<CLT 3>立会人<CLT>って…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Witness<CLT> to what...?"
msgstr ""

#. こいつが、さっきからナメた事を抜かしやがんだよ。
#. オレを根性無しだとかよぉ…
msgctxt "0003 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"This guy's been talkin' shit about me since day one.\n"
"Callin' me a coward and shit like that..."
msgstr ""

#. 根性無しだから、
#. すぐに暴力に頼ろうとするのだろう！？
msgctxt "0004 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You *are* a coward! That's why you turn to violence to\n"
"solve your problems!"
msgstr ""

#. 根性無しだから、社会やルールを守れず、
#. そんな恰好で珍走しているのだろうッ！？
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"That's why you can't do what society asks of you, why\n"
"you walk around dressed like that!"
msgstr ""

#. あんだと…？
msgctxt "0006 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "...The fuck you say?"
msgstr ""

#. テメェに…何が…わかんだ……
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "You dunno shit."
msgstr ""

#. 君は、すでに君自身に負けている！
#. 根性がないから、それを認めようとしないだけだッ！！
msgctxt "0008 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You've already lost to yourself, but you're such a\n"
"coward you don't even realize it!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…テメェにはあるってのか？
#. オレ以上の根性がよぉ…
msgctxt "0009 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"So what, you sayin' you're *not* a coward? You think\n"
"you're tougher than me?"
msgstr ""

#. 無論だッ！
msgctxt "0010 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I *know* I am!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら…<CLT 3>勝負<CLT>だ…
#. オレより根性あるってんなら証明してみろや！！
msgctxt "0011 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Okay, then let's <CLT 3>throw down<CLT>. Prove you got what I\n"
"don't got!"
msgstr ""

#. 望むところだッ！
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I accept your challenge!"
msgstr ""

#. つー訳でよ、
#. 苗木！　オメェが立会人やれや！！
msgctxt "0013 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"So that's what's happenin', Makoto. You gotta be our\n"
"witness!"
msgstr ""

#. 勝負って…殴り合う訳じゃないよね？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're gonna...throw down? You're not gonna\n"
"like...start punching each other, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. …寄宿舎の１階に風呂場があったろ？
#. あそこにはサウナもあったなぁ…？
msgctxt "0015 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"There's a bathhouse on the 1st floor of the dorm,\n"
"right? With a sauna inside?"
msgstr ""

#. なるほど、単純明快な勝負だ…
msgctxt "0016 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I see...a simple endurance contest, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>どちらが長くサウナでガマン出来るか<CLT>、
#. それを競い合おうと言う訳だなッ！！
msgctxt "0017 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"We're going to see <CLT 3>who can stay in the sauna the\n"
"longest<CLT>, am I right!?"
msgstr ""

#. そういう事だ、コラァ！！
msgctxt "0018 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Goddamn straight!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>空腹を満たそうと立ち寄った食堂…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just wanted to get something to eat.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで事件は起きた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And now I'm about to get roped into something like\n"
"this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、すでに起きていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Actually, no...I guess I'm *already* roped in.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おおっ、苗木くん！
#. いいところに来たなッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Hey, Makoto! Perfect timing!"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　何が…？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木…！
#. オメェによぉ、頼みがあんだけどよぉ…！
msgctxt "0024 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "I have a favor to ask!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>頼みって…
#. 明らかに…嫌な予感が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A favor...? I have a bad feeling about this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おうっ、苗木よぉ…
#. ちっと<CLT 1>【立会人】<CLT>になれや。
msgctxt "0026 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "C'mon, Makoto. You gotta be our <CLT 1>[witness]<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>た、立会人…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>W-Witness...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木くん！　いいところに来たッ！！
#. ぜひとも、協力をお願いしたい！！
msgctxt "0028 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You came at just the right time! I must ask for your\n"
"full cooperation!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はこんなモニターなんか
#. 気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about a monitor right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はこんな監視カメラなんか
#. 気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about a surveillance camera\n"
"right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ夜時間だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's almost nighttime, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は時間を気にしている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...that's not important right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待ちたまえ、苗木くんッ！
msgctxt "0033 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Makoto, hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. ぜひとも、協力をお願いしたいのだ！
msgctxt "0034 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I must ask for your full cooperation!"
msgstr ""

#. うぉぉぉい！！　待ちやがれッ！
msgctxt "0035 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Heeeey! Get back here!"
msgstr ""

#. オレが頼んでんだ！
#. 話くらい聞いたらどうだ？　あぁ？
msgctxt "0036 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What, you're too good to talk to me? Huh!?"
msgstr ""
